/ « À emporter avec toi » (Michael, 2026-11-25) : la liste des anciennes pages
  de réservation, reprise au tutoiement — serviettes, draps, savon
  biodégradable, papier toilette. Rendue seulement si le séjour a un gîte ou
  une chambre (`StayDecorator#show_packing_list?`). Les draps restent à
  emporter, avec le prix de la location sur demande (Michael, 2026-11-26).
section.funnel-card.mt-6.p-5.md:p-6(data-stay-packing="true")
  .flex.items-start.gap-3
    span.text-forest.flex-shrink-0.mt-0.5
      = funnel_icon :briefcase, css_class: "w-6 h-6"
    div.min-w-0.flex-1
      h2.funnel-section-title.mb-3 = t("public.stays.packing.heading")

      ul.space-y-3.text-base.text-ink(role="list")
        li.flex.items-start.gap-2
          span.text-forest.flex-shrink-0.mt-0.5 = funnel_icon :check, css_class: "w-5 h-5"
          span.font-semibold = t("public.stays.packing.towels")
        li.flex.items-start.gap-2(data-stay-packing-sheets="true")
          span.text-forest.flex-shrink-0.mt-0.5 = funnel_icon :check, css_class: "w-5 h-5"
          span
            span.font-semibold = t("public.stays.packing.sheets")
            span.block.text-sm(class="text-moss") = t("public.stays.packing.sheets_option_1")
            span.block.text-sm(class="text-moss") = t("public.stays.packing.sheets_option_2")
            span.mt-1.block.text-sm.text-ink(data-stay-linen-rental="true")
              = t("public.stays.packing.sheets_rental",
                  single: @stay.linen_rental_price_label(:single_bed),
                  double: @stay.linen_rental_price_label(:double_bed))
        li.flex.items-start.gap-2
          span.text-forest.flex-shrink-0.mt-0.5 = funnel_icon :check, css_class: "w-5 h-5"
          span
            span.font-semibold = t("public.stays.packing.soap")
            span.block.text-sm(class="text-moss") = t("public.stays.packing.soap_note")
        li.flex.items-start.gap-2
          span.text-forest.flex-shrink-0.mt-0.5 = funnel_icon :check, css_class: "w-5 h-5"
          span.font-semibold = t("public.stays.packing.toilet_paper")
